; woods_canopy.room - the treetops above woods_deep (design 04 section 3.4). Gate: the opening up to
; orchard_terraces (cols 4-11) is 7 rows above the launch branch (row 4): double jump only.
; WORLD-41: the 384 px drop back from orchard_terraces' hole lands on cols 4-8 in a SoftLanding (`n`, 6,8; 5 cells
; wide, 3 tall) under the blossom_heap prop, like the other drops back ("Straight drop into deep snow
; (Recommended)", user, 2026-10-15).

